{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/wishlistgif.gif?t=1738494770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GR\u00c4UEL</strong> is a cooperative horror game (1 to 5 players) where you dive into an endless nightmare. Work as a team to survive the abominations' crises and discover their common history in your nightmares. Preserve your mental health or sink into hell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/Story.png?t=1738494770\" />Dive into the darkness of an alternate world where Germany won the Second World War. In this world, secret and cruel experiments are conducted on humans to satisfy a thirst for control and power. You are one of these guinea pigs, held captive in a research and experimentation center, subjected to the terrifying nightmares orchestrated by the sinister Dr. Schmidt and his team of unscrupulous doctors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/Multiplayer.png?t=1738494770\" />Enjoy this experience online with up to 5 players, play with voice chat and cooperate to fight against the abomination. Together, try to uncover the secrets of this nightmare and find a way to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/Single_Player.png?t=1738494770\" />Do you have the courage to play alone? In this experience, there will only be the abomination to keep you company\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/Unique_Gameplay.png?t=1738494770\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light will be your ally to regenerate your mental health.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/sante.gif?t=1738494770\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into terrifying nightmares and use your passive and active skills to face them. Passive powers give you permanent advantages, while active powers allow you to trigger powerful effects to get you out of difficult situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/comp.gif?t=1738494770\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate the frequency machine to alter the course of the game, intensify the difficulty, and accumulate more XP.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/gif_Dream.gif?t=1738494770\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To progress in the nightmare, you will have to find and merge two specific masks to give a face to the guardians of the portals that block your progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/mask.gif?t=1738494770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/PlayerProgression.png?t=1738494770\" />At the end of each game, you will accumulate experience, which will allow you to increase your level. For each level, rewards will be attributed to you. (cosmetics, Tears of Resilience, passive or active skills, \u2026) Tears of Resilience are used to improve your passive and active powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/pass.gif?t=1738494770\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/Achievements.png?t=1738494770\" />Would you dare to complete the 15 Steam achievements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/NightmareMode.png?t=1738494770\" />Do you like difficulty? The nightmare mode is available\u2026 at your own risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/extras/join_our_discord_end_page.png?t=1738494770\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2215790?t=1738494770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738494770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/d813638e54369cbd69b6f39971b2f38cd9535acd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738494770","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215790/d813638e54369cbd69b6f39971b2f38cd9535acd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738494770","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may include content that is not suitable for all ages or for viewing at work :\r\nDisturbing images, intense violence